OL,3,GNEWSASamurai sword, #70k and gun seized
OL,4,Ain drug raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized a samurai sword and
OL,7,Fa semi-automatic gun along with #70,000
OL,8,Fin cash after a series of drug raids.
OL,10,FCocaine and MDMA were also found
OL,11,Falongside the firearm and ammunition,
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,14,FGMP said four men, in their 20s and
OL,15,F30s, were arrested and five more later
OL,16,Fcame forward themselves.
OL,18,FAll nine have now been released on bail
OL,19,Fpending further inquiries.
